BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Skyward:" Anne Patterson & James Teschner
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTSTAMP:20260925T153159Z
UID:63bc18948175dc9b56171b38cd46@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:"Skyward:" Anne Patterson &amp\; James Teschner Exhibition Dat
 es: September 5- October 3\, 2026 Opening Reception: Saturday September 5
 \, 2026\, 5:00- 7:00 PM "Skyward:" Anne Patterson &amp\; James Teschner Je
 ssica Hagen Fine Art + Design is pleased to announce the opening of "Skywa
 rd" featuring artists James Teschner and Anne Patterson on Saturday Septem
 ber 5\, 2026\, from 5:00- 7:00 PM. This exhibition showcases the paintings
  of James Teschner and the sculptural orbs of Anne Patterson. Teschner\, p
 ainting outdoors near his home in the remote farmlands of central France f
 ocuses on the setting sun\, the moon\, the sky\, and “those moments lead
 ing towards nightfall\, and the night itself\, whereby the landscape is ei
 ther being obliterated\, almost devoured by the sun’s all-consuming lumi
 nosity or being dissolved by the receding\, diminishing light.” Anne Pat
 terson is a multi-disciplinary artist based in Brooklyn. Working across pa
 inting\, sculpture\, and installation\, Patterson explores the ways our se
 nses overlap\, and how together they create an experience greater than the
  sum of its parts. Informed by her own synesthesia and her training as a s
 et designer\, she is often inspired by music and sound. Gallery owner Jess
 ica Hagen states\, “This is a magical exhibition. The radiance of James 
 Teschner’s oil paintings coalesce with the glow of Anne Patterson’s go
 ld-leafed orbs\, resulting in a sublime alchemy. It’s really a very spec
 ial show.” "Skyward" closes October 3\, 2026. Jessica Hagen Fine Art + D
 esign was founded in 2005 and features contemporary art including painting
 \, sculpture\, photography\, ceramics\, textiles\, and jewelry. Located in
  the historic Point section of Newport\, the gallery’s hours are Wednesd
 ay- Saturday 11:00 AM - 5:00 PM and Sunday 12:00- 5:00 PM. The gallery is 
 also open by appointment.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/even
 t/skyward%3a-anne-patterson-%26-james-teschner/111508/
LOCATION:Jessica Hagen Fine Art & Design\, 9A Bridge Street\, Newport\, RI
  02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/skyward%3a-anne-patterson-%26-j
 ames-teschner/111508/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amethyst Night (Reversible!)- Couples or Singles Session - Paintin
 g Class
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTSTAMP:20260925T153159Z
UID:020da1cf18809be3a4db7a0e1334@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:🖌️ IN-STUDIO SESSION DETAILS Reserve your spot and enjoy 
 a complimentary beverage—choose from soda\, beer\, or wine (21+ with val
 id ID). Additional drinks will be available for purchase. Immerse yourself
  in a fun and creative atmosphere while painting your own unique masterpie
 ce! Recommended for ages 14 and up. ⏰ ARRIVAL TIME Our studio opens 30 m
 inutes prior to class time. We recommend arriving 15&#8211\;30 minutes ear
 ly to find parking\, grab a drink\, and get settled. Please note: If you a
 rrive late\, the artist may not be able to fill you in on the steps you mi
 ssed\, as they will be focused on guiding the rest of the class. If you ar
 rive more than 20 minutes late\, we kindly ask that you do not join the se
 ssion. Late arrivals can be disruptive and may not have enough time to com
 plete the painting. Unfortunately\, we cannot offer refunds or reschedules
  for late arrivals. 🚗 PARKING INFO Our studio is located at 150 Main St
 reet (rear entrance)\, Pawtucket\, Rhode Island\, and we have two FREE par
 king lots: 🚗 One directly attached to our entrance 🚗 A second lot ju
 st one building down on the same side of the street — clearly labeled 
 🪑 WANT TO SIT WITH FRIENDS? If you purchased 2 or more tickets in one t
 ransaction\, we’ll automatically seat your group together. If you booked
  separately but want to sit with someone\, please include their first and 
 last names in the “Additional Information / Order Notes” field during 
 checkout. 🔄 RESCHEDULING &amp\; CANCELLATION POLICY All reservations ar
 e non-refundable. However\, if you need to reschedule\, you may request a 
 reschedule voucher at least 48 hours before your session. You can do this 
 easily on our website — just [click here]. No-shows cannot be reschedule
 d. 🚨 CLASS CANCELLATION Classes may be canceled due to low attendance. 
 In this case\, we’ll notify you and issue a voucher for a future session
 . We appreciate your understanding and look forward to welcoming you to a 
 future class! ❄️ INCLEMENT WEATHER POLICY Because New England weather 
 can be unpredictable\, we typically wait until a few hours before class to
  make final decisions. If we cancel due to snow or other severe weather\, 
 we’ll email you a voucher for a future session. Have more questions? Che
 ck out our [Frequently Asked Questions] page — just [click here].\n\nSou
 rce: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/amethyst-night-(reversible!)-c
 ouples-or-singles-session-painting-class/111342/
LOCATION:Paint & Vino\, 150 Main Street\, Pawtucket\, 02860
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/amethyst-night-(reversible!)-co
 uples-or-singles-session-painting-class/111342/
END:VEVENT
